# Rosetta native corpus exclusions: files in native.index that one port does not run.
#
#   <port>[:<runner>]  <file>  <reason>
#
# port:   c python swift rust go zig java kotlin csharp csharp-bid
# runner: core wrapper net11 (net11: the csharp / csharp-bid Decimal128.Net11.Rosetta
#         program). Without a runner, the file is excluded from every runner of
#         that port.
# reason: required, the rest of the line. Remove the line when the reason no
#         longer holds.
#
# Example:
#   swift  transcsweep.txt  still on D38; remove at the D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
#
# Checked by rosetta/check_native.py (run by CI).

# D48 transcendental sweeps (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md D-6). The D38 domain fails ~2,800
# of these lines; each port removes its two lines in the commit that switches it to
# D48 (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md D-7). Swift switched in Phase 4.
go          transcstress.txt  still on D38; remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
go          transcsweep.txt   still on D38; remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
java        transcstress.txt  still on D38; remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
java        transcsweep.txt   still on D38; remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
kotlin      transcstress.txt  still on D38; remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
kotlin      transcsweep.txt   still on D38; remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
csharp      transcstress.txt  still on D38; remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
csharp      transcsweep.txt   still on D38; remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
csharp-bid  transcstress.txt  still on D38; remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
csharp-bid  transcsweep.txt   still on D38; remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)

# Corrected compound/rootn vectors (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md Phase 4). Every D38 port
# computes the old, wrong last digit; each removes its line at its D48 switch.
go          transcfix.txt     still on D38 (computes the old wrong value); remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
java        transcfix.txt     still on D38 (computes the old wrong value); remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
kotlin      transcfix.txt     still on D38 (computes the old wrong value); remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
csharp      transcfix.txt     still on D38 (computes the old wrong value); remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
csharp-bid  transcfix.txt     still on D38 (computes the old wrong value); remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)

# pown / rootn oracle vectors moved out of pown.txt / rootn.txt (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md
# Phase 6). D38 fails about 309 of the pown lines; each port removes its line at its
# D48 switch.
go          transcoracle.txt  still on D38 (fails ~309 pown lines); remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
java        transcoracle.txt  still on D38 (fails ~309 pown lines); remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
kotlin      transcoracle.txt  still on D38 (fails ~309 pown lines); remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
csharp      transcoracle.txt  still on D38 (fails ~309 pown lines); remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
csharp-bid  transcoracle.txt  still on D38 (fails ~309 pown lines); remove at this port's D48 switch (D48SwiftWorkOrder.md)
